  "steps": [
    "Melt the butter in an oven-safe pan over medium-low heat.",
    "Once bubbling, turn off the heat and stir in both sugars. If it splits, whisk in a little boiling water.",
    "Stir in the vanilla, cool 2 minutes, then whisk in the eggs one at a time, quickly.",
    "Mix in the flour and salt to a thick batter, then fold in the white chocolate and berries, pressing extra chocolate chunks on top.",
    "Bake at 180 °C for 30 minutes.",
    "Serve with ice cream, a drizzle of melted white chocolate and raspberries."
